  "imagery": "Cinematic documentary-style photography dominates — warm-toned, natural-light portraits of founders, athletes, and artists in their working environments (unrolling blueprints at a wooden table, recording in a vocal booth, gazing through office windows). Images are treated as full-bleed hero stills or 10px-radius card containers, never cropped to product-spec tightness. Color treatment is warm-neutral, slightly desaturated, evoking 35mm film stock with shallow depth of field. No illustrations, no product screenshots, no 3D renders, no icon sets. The mood is intimate and observational — these are people building things in real spaces, not lifestyle stock photography. The custom logo wordmark \"sequel\" uses a four vertical-bar mark (||||) that reads as a sound wave or equalizer, hinting at the brand's audio/film DNA.",
